{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Scan area. If object visible, approach it. If close, take it, then check it. Perform task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <SubTree ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = MoveRandomly    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectLifted    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
    "BT": {
